OL,3,GNEWSAA third of homeless people are in
OL,4,Awork, data shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaving a job is no guarantee of a home,
OL,7,Fa charity has said after latest figures
OL,8,Fshowed a third of people receiving
OL,9,Fhomelessness assistance in Jersey were
OL,10,Fin work.
OL,12,FJersey's Q2 2026 homelessness report
OL,13,Ffound that 33% of people receiving
OL,14,Fassistance were employed, while nearly
OL,15,F60% were unemployed and 9% were in
OL,16,Feducation or retired.
OL,18,FJosephine Scott, director of The
OL,19,FShelter Trust, said the number of
OL,20,Fhomeless in work was an "important
OL,21,Freminder that homelessness doesn't only
OL,22,Faffect people who are unemployed".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
