OL,3,GNEWSAA third of homeless people are in
OL,4,Awork, data shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report found 271 people received
OL,7,Fhelp from homelessness services between
OL,8,FApril and June, down from 287 in the
OL,9,Fprevious quarter.
